    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO                   "Orders the unit to attack enemies within the engage radius of the unit. This is the default order."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_ATTACK_ENEMIES    "Orders the unit to attack enemies within the engage radius of the unit's starting position. If the enemy moves out of the unit's engage radius or there is no enemy, the unit moves to its starting position."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_ATTACK_ANY        "Orders the unit to attack any enemies within the engage radius of the target structure."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_MOVE_ALONG        "Orders the unit to move along the specified path after the Delay time has elapsed. The unit will stop and attack enemies along its way. It remains at its final destination point for the rest of the game."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_MOVE_ALONG_THE_SPECIFIED "Orders the unit to move along the specified path after the Delay time has elapsed. The unit will stop to fight enemies within its given engage radius unless Move && Fire is selected. Once the unit reaches its final destination point, it will continue to its starting position and continue to loop."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_MOVE_ALONG_THE_SPECIFIED_PATH_AFTER "Orders the unit to move along the specified path after the Delay time has elapsed. The unit will stop to fight enemies within its given engage radius unless Move && Fire is selected. The unit will continuously move back and forth between its starting position and final destination point."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_MOVE_TO           "Orders the unit to move to the given structure after the Delay time has elapsed. Once the unit gets there, it will attack the given structure. The unit will stop along the way to attack any enemies it encounters."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_MOVE_TOWARD       "Orders the unit to move toward the given unit after the Delay time has elapsed. Once the unit reaches the given unit, it will attack. The unit will attack any other units that get within its given engage radius."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_REMAIN_INVISIBLE  "Orders the unit to remain invisible to sensors until it is engaged."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_FOLLOW_THE        "Orders the unit to follow the selected unit, staying to the side indicated by Relative Direction."
    IDS_ORDERS_THE_UNIT_TO_NOT_MOVE          "Orders the unit to not move or attack."
END

